# Copy to .env. Never commit .env — it is gitignored.
#
# REQUIRED. This server ships no client ID: register your own app and put its
# Application (client) ID here. See docs/app-registration.md. A personal
# Microsoft account needs no administrator. A work or school tenant on
# Microsoft's default consent policy does: an admin must grant Tasks.ReadWrite
# (or Tasks.Read), even for an app you registered yourself.
TODO_MCP_CLIENT_ID=

# Your mailbox's IANA time zone (Outlook → Settings → Language and time), for
# example Europe/Prague. Left unset, the server uses UTC and warns loudly at
# startup and in `doctor`: Microsoft To Do anchors due dates to your mailbox's
# zone, so with the wrong one "due today" and "overdue" are off by one day for
# part of every day. That is why this line ships commented out: uncomment it
# with YOUR zone.
#
# The tzdb is compiled into the binary (the image has no /usr/share/zoneinfo),
# so any IANA name is accepted for reading. Dated writes need a zone Microsoft
# Graph can map to a Windows time-zone name: `doctor` shows it as "Windows name
# for writes", and a dated write in a zone without one is refused with a nearby
# zone suggested.
# TODO_MCP_TZ=Europe/Prague

# Tasks.ReadWrite (default) or Tasks.Read; any other value is refused.
# Tasks.Read is a ceiling: the five write tools are left out of tools/list even
# if your app registration was already consented for Tasks.ReadWrite. The
# stored refresh token is read-only only if the registration grants just
# Tasks.Read; otherwise login, serve and doctor warn that it can write your
# tasks. Changing this value requires a new `login`.
# TODO_MCP_SCOPE=Tasks.ReadWrite

# Optional. A tenant GUID or domain if the app registration is single-tenant.
# TODO_MCP_TENANT=common

# Optional. Extra Host header values to accept, comma-separated, when the server
# is reached by a name other than localhost / its bind address.
# TODO_MCP_ALLOWED_HOSTS=

# Optional tuning — see the Configuration table in README.md for every knob.
# TODO_MCP_CACHE_TTL_SECONDS=120
# TODO_MCP_GRAPH_CONCURRENCY=4
